function portalAuth(configured,invitation){let portal=invitation?'client':'admin';let formMode=configured?'login':'setup';const portalInfo={client:['Client portal','View residences, arrivals, shopping, requests and reports.'],admin:['Admin portal',configured?'Manage your EstateAegis workspace.':'Create and manage the EstateAegis workspace.'],vendor:['Vendor portal','View assigned jobs, upload evidence and track completion.']};const draw=()=>{const info=portalInfo[portal];const isSetup=portal==='admin'&&!configured&&formMode==='setup';$('app').innerHTML=`<div class="auth"><section class="auth-intro"><video class="auth-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/waterfront.jpg" aria-hidden="true"><source src="/waterfront.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="brand"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="46" height="46" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke="#d9b67f" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" style="flex-shrink:0"><path d="M7 29 32 12 57 29M14 25v17m36-17v17M25 40V29h14v11"/><path d="M7 47c8-6 17-6 25 0s17 6 25 0M7 55c8-6 17-6 25 0s17 6 25 0"/></svg>EstateAegis</div><h1>Your residences.<br>Our team.<br>One place.</h1><p>The smarter way to manage private residences.</p></section><section class="auth-form"><div><div class="eyebrow">EstateAegis access</div><h2>${esc(info[0])}</h2><p class="muted">${esc(info[1])}</p><div class="portal-tiles">${Object.entries(portalInfo).map(([key,value])=>`<button type="button" class="portal-tile ${portal===key?'selected':''}" data-portal="${key}"><strong>${key==='client'?'Client':key==='admin'?'Admin':'Vendor'}</strong><span>${esc(value[1])}</span></button>`).join('')}</div><div id="authError" class="error" hidden></div><form id="authForm">${invitation?input('name','Your name'):isSetup?input('company','Company name')+logoField()+input('setupKey','Setup key from Render','password','',false)+input('name','Your name'):input('email','Email','email')}${invitation?input('email','Invited email','email'):''}${input('password','Password','password')}${input('code','Authenticator or recovery code (if enabled)','text','',false)}<button class="primary" type="submit">${isSetup?'Create company':'Log in'}</button></form>${isSetup?'<p class="footer-note">Admin setup is for the person running the workspace. Other people use their assigned portal to log in.</p>':'<p class="footer-note">Use the portal assigned to your account. Ask the administrator for an invitation if you need access.</p>'}</div></section></div>`;document.querySelectorAll('[data-portal]').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>{portal=button.dataset.portal;formMode=portal==='admin'&&!configured?'setup':'login';draw();});$('authForm').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();e.submitter.disabled=true;try{const payload=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.target));if(e.target.querySelector('[name=companyLogo]'))payload.logoData=await readCompanyLogo(e.target);if(invitation)payload.token=invitation;await api(invitation?'accept-invite':isSetup?'setup':'login',isSetup?payload:{...payload,role:portal});history.replaceState(null,'','/');await load();}catch(error){$('authError').textContent=error.message;$('authError').hidden=false;}finally{e.submitter.disabled=false;}};};draw();}
